---
// src/components/astro/Solutions.astro
---

<section class="solutions section-light" id="services">
  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="sub-title">Marketing Operations & Growth Consulting</span>
      <h2 class="main-title">Diagnose What’s Not Working. Prioritize What Matters. Improve What’s Next.</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        I review the full marketing picture to uncover gaps, friction, and missed opportunities. Then I create a practical action plan and can help implement the highest-priority improvements.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Solutions Grid -->
    <div class="solutions-grid reveal-stagger">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Full Marketing Audit -->
      <div class="solution-card reveal-item">
        <div class="card-icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="card-svg">
            <path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path>
            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.15"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">Full Marketing Audit</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Review the full marketing picture—including your website, positioning, offers, channels, campaigns, CRM, funnels, customer journeys, and measurement—to identify gaps, friction, and missed opportunities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Priorities & Action Plan -->
      <div class="solution-card reveal-item">
        <div class="card-icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="card-svg">
            <path d="M2 12h20M12 2v20"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6" stroke-width="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">Priorities & Action Plan</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Turn the findings into a clear action plan organized around business goals, likely impact, effort, and dependencies. Focus first on the highest-priority opportunities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Websites, Offers & Conversion Paths -->
      <div class="solution-card reveal-item">
        <div class="card-icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="card-svg">
            <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
            <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">Websites, Offers & Conversion Paths</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Improve how prospects understand your value and move toward action. This can include website structure, messaging, offers, landing pages, funnels, and key conversion paths.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Acquisition & Channel Strategy -->
      <div class="solution-card reveal-item">
        <div class="card-icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="card-svg">
            <polygon points="22 3 2 3 10 12.46 10 19 14 21 14 12.46 22 3"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">Acquisition & Channel Strategy</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Assess where and how to reach the right audiences across paid and organic channels. Support can include paid acquisition, channel planning, campaign structure, and creative or content direction.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: CRM, Follow-Up & Customer Journeys -->
      <div class="solution-card reveal-item">
        <div class="card-icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="card-svg">
            <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line>
            <line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line>
            <path d="M2 20h20"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">CRM, Follow-Up & Customer Journeys</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Strengthen what happens after someone becomes a lead or customer through better CRM structure, email follow-up, automation, segmentation, and lifecycle journeys.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6: Analytics, Reporting & Smarter Workflows -->
      <div class="solution-card reveal-item">
        <div class="card-icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="card-svg">
            <polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"></polyline>
            <polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">Analytics, Reporting & Smarter Workflows</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Make performance easier to understand through practical tracking, reporting, and measurement. Where useful, AI-assisted workflows can support research, analysis, content development, and everyday marketing execution.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .solutions {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-light-deep);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem;
  }

  .sub-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headings);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .main-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--color-text-light-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-desc {
    color: var(--color-text-light-secondary);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* Cards Grid */
  .solutions-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .solution-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-light-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .solution-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04), var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .card-icon-box {
    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 2.75rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .solution-card:hover .card-icon-box {
    background: var(--gradient-blue-cyan);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  .card-svg {
    width: 1.35rem;
    height: 1.35rem;
  }

  .card-heading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-light-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Responsive styling */
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .solutions-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .solutions-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .solution-card {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
